{"4779480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Atrium Mortis", "steam_appid": 4779480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779480/extras/8429a742e642b0d5d6ad4bc73cb30f1d.avif?t=1787673255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779480/extras_big/8429a742e642b0d5d6ad4bc73cb30f1d.webp?t=1787673255 width=1560 height=433 /></span>is a story-driven, first-person psychological horror inspired by genre classics. You play as Arthur, who awakens from a nightmare inside his family estate, a place abandoned years ago. He has no memory of how he got here, yet it’s clear he was expected. But by whom, and for what purpose? You must descend into the darkest corners of the forsaken house to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember: some doors are better left locked.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Darkness Means Doom, Light is Salvation:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arthur has suffered from nyctophobia since childhood, making the dark literally drive him mad. Your sanity is a fragile resource tied directly to the light. The longer you linger in the shadows or witness the unexplainable, the more reality distorts. Scavenge for fuel, keep your lamp lit, and stay in the light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779480/extras/44d6544b289d8d31868aa4c156f2499d.poster.avif?t=1787673255\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779480/extras/44d6544b289d8d31868aa4c156f2499d.webm?t=1787673255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779480/extras/44d6544b289d8d31868aa4c156f2499d.mp4?t=1787673255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fears Come Alive:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are powerless against the horrors roaming the mansion. Sometimes your best option is to run; other times, you must become one with the shadows and hide. Avoid the monsters whenever possible, even from a safe distance—just laying eyes on them shatters your mental state. However, a specific item exists within the game to help you combat this fear and restore your sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779480/extras/a665e7ca333164de690356cafe8b0020.poster.avif?t=1787673255\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779480/extras/a665e7ca333164de690356cafe8b0020.webm?t=1787673255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779480/extras/a665e7ca333164de690356cafe8b0020.mp4?t=1787673255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Mystery of the Manor:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must piece together the chronology of events, gathering fragments of the past through scattered notes and forgotten items. Solve puzzles, delve deeper into the abyss of your fears, and uncover the dark secret hidden within the walls of the abandoned estate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779480/extras/7190edb1683920c1fcf99365a1b7f1c2.poster.avif?t=1787673255\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779480/extras/7190edb1683920c1fcf99365a1b7f1c2.webm?t=1787673255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779480/extras/7190edb1683920c1fcf99365a1b7f1c2.mp4?t=1787673255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779480/extras/8429a742e642b0d5d6ad4bc73cb30f1d.avif?t=1787673255\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779480/extras_big/8429a742e642b0d5d6ad4bc73cb30f1d.webp?t=1787673255 width=1560 height=433 /></span>is a story-driven, first-person psychological horror inspired by genre classics. You play as Arthur, who awakens from a nightmare inside his family estate, a place abandoned years ago. He has no memory of how he got here, yet it’s clear he was expected. But by whom, and for what purpose? You must descend into the darkest corners of the forsaken house to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember: some doors are better left locked.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Darkness Means Doom, Light is Salvation:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arthur has suffered from nyctophobia since childhood, making the dark literally drive him mad. Your sanity is a fragile resource tied directly to the light. The longer you linger in the shadows or witness the unexplainable, the more reality distorts. Scavenge for fuel, keep your lamp lit, and stay in the light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779480/extras/44d6544b289d8d31868aa4c156f2499d.poster.avif?t=1787673255\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779480/extras/44d6544b289d8d31868aa4c156f2499d.webm?t=1787673255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><s